  "id": "primary-coping",
  "term": "primary coping",
  "definition": "Primary coping is a way of dealing with stress by trying to change the situation or environment rather than adjusting oneself to fit it. In the source, it is contrasted with secondary coping, which involves fitting into the environment.",
